# Allowlist. Applies only to docker/dbt-sandbox/Dockerfile (BuildKit reads
# <Dockerfile>.dockerignore in preference to the root .dockerignore), so the
# Lite build is unaffected. Anything not listed -- .env, vendor/, runs/, the
# gold sets -- cannot enter this build context.
*
!pyproject.toml
!README.md
!src/
!evals/dbt/sandbox_tools/
!docker/dbt-sandbox/requirements.txt
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
